flowchart TD
    A[Child reaches toward therapist face] --> B[Adult gently blocks or holds hand]
    B --> C[Same short rule: Hands down / Do not touch face]
    C --> D[Prompt replacement: shoulder touch, high five, wave, or hands in lap]
    D --> E{Replacement behavior?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Reinforce: Nice hands down]
    E -- No --> G[Adult steps back briefly: 5 to 10 seconds]
    F --> H[Continue activity calmly]
    G --> I[Return calmly with low attention]
    I --> D
    H --> J{Face-touch repeats?}
    J -- No --> K[Continue and record success]
    J -- Yes --> G
